      "nativeChanges": "Unmodified upstream files; opensim_prefix.h is force-included to isolate public/internal symbols. The native port supplies no .NET runtime dependency. The C++ wrapper initializes CPU feature dispatch with call_once and supplies zeroed calloc/free allocations; upstream source files are unchanged. The prefix header supplies a Clang target-specific CRC32 helper; the dispatched CRC-folding translation unit has local PCLMUL/SSSE3/SSE4 flags. No global CPU ISA requirement is added.",
      "revision": "dotnet/runtime v8.0.31"
    },
